  - The young queen has a businesslike character!
  - The situation is so-so. I need to get more gold urgently.
  - One of the noble families is just ready to pay for part of the territory of the
    snake province.
  - Formally, the local population still receives income from it.
  - But who cares about monsters when you're being offered a tidy sum?
